From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LNPANDY <lnp-andy@hotmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 07:50:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gfx: adaptive iOS memory-pressure convergence for recycled
 render-target heaps

Expand the single DISPATCH_SOURCE_TYPE_MEMORYPRESSURE listener on iOS so
WARN/CRITICAL pressure also schedules a submit-thread trim in mtl_sub_begin()
that drains idle texture ghost entries down to 64 while sparing in-use entries,
restores NGHOST as soon as g_rh_pressure clears, releases packaged texture
spare copies, clears the view cache, evicts idle unreferenced shared textures,
drops idle upload staging slot blocks, and calls malloc_zone_pressure_relief.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Converge iOS DM_NVN_RT_RECYCLE placement heap pool caps and texture/staging caches under low memory and dispatch pressure while preserving macOS defaults
Issue: none
